{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "1f82e66e1d2b33b4a3c0c8ec1fe6b7d7e2600bfe9d399bf2539620fda055cdcd", "ja": "トレーニング・ハイッ", "zh": "Training High", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ecfb72e9810256027372dbaf570852f829a740fe1127e00b35827dd1be296cac", "ja": "レッスンのためランニングを続けるメンバー\n達。ひなたは農作業の経験から、焦らず一定\nのペースを保てばいいとアドバイスする。バ\nテ気味だったエミリーも含めて全員無事に完\n走し、運動後の麦茶を楽しむのだった。", "zh": "成员们为了训练而持续跑步。\n日向根据从事农务工作的经验，\n建议大家不要心急，保持一定的步调就好。\n包含有点精疲力尽的艾蜜莉在内，\n全员都顺利跑完全程，享用着运动后的麦茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b7d1203328909ad0856023b582e11aa1fa34eab31eb6c1b4537e3ab6471aca3f", "ja": "（今日のレッスンは、ランニング。\nそのための備えは、ばっちりしてきたぞ！）", "zh": "（今天的训练是跑步，\n为此我做好了万全的准备！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d6e6178eb21c0734a1ba921580efc117a463835433fdae5792edf164353a8e5a", "ja": "ミネラルウォーター、スポーツドリンク、塩飴に\n冷却グッズ……たくさん用意したから、使ってくれ。", "zh": "我准备了很多矿泉水、运动饮料、盐糖\n还有消暑用品……大家尽管使用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "10feda155724073ca6b7eac95230899b2c77f1226a9aa62b0038ca652399ac40", "ja": "エレナさんは、今日はお仕事なんですね。\n私たち4人で、がんばりましょう！", "zh": "艾琳娜今天去工作了，\n就我们四人一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "db7006dc2414a14bd715919f0046211a8261a70d3aa63f0b14e51717ca339e4f", "ja": "なあなあ、{$P$}さん。\n小鳥さんの麦茶も持ってきてくれたんやろ？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生。\n你也有带小鸟姊泡的麦茶来，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1fa5bcdf7792f4d7fecee19c895a570fc3d109c4a683dcf4624777870038a0e5", "ja": "ああ、音無さん特製麦茶もたっぷりあるぞ。\nとはいえ……みんな、気を付けて走るように！", "zh": "对啊，也有满满的音无小姐特制麦茶喔。\n话虽如此……大家跑步时还是要谨慎点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "12967ccbe8a12226a11f75d8368cf7d32369de35792bdd3032b2660eae8155d3", "ja": "さあっ！　ぶっとばして行っくでー！\n関西の星の脚力、見せつけたるわ♪", "zh": "来吧！往前冲啰──！\n让你们看看关西之星的脚力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1010_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "026b39f22d8410426e65c0257de14db7918e10605dbdf0cd899895582ff446d0", "ja": "みんな！\nそろそろ休憩にしよう！", "zh": "大家！\n差不多该休息一下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "368c3d92b88f32d4578ba298f577cf0c9437961a2e5403395ced93e9d3634cb4", "ja": "はあ、はあ……は、はい！", "zh": "呼、呼……好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "5fcb70f4c6c25865bee73cc98ec2a8dc9217236a52ffb9eafb720085de3c5e2b", "ja": "ふう……やっぱりこの暑さの中でランニングは\nきついわね。汗で日焼け止め、落ちちゃったかも。", "zh": "呼……在这种大热天跑步果然很吃力呢，\n涂好的防晒似乎都因为流汗而脱落了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6e48c705ef78b9c10a149c7d25a97d3220281fb900b6d25f0a0593d5e50f3554", "ja": "みんな、水分補給のほうは大丈夫か？\nこの音無さん特製麦茶を飲むと、元気が出るぞ！", "zh": "大家都有补充足够的水分吗？\n喝下这杯音无小姐特制麦茶就会恢复活力喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "4509505b72fe7e3a26c44f656e7e2d8a8c6f6d345e53a847704b67719edb1938", "ja": "くぅ～！　運動の後は、やっぱこれが一番！\nおいしいし、力が溢れてくるし、最高の一杯やな！", "zh": "唔～！运动后果然就是要来一杯这个！\n既好喝又能让人充满力量，实在太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "e5e700ff9b10bb63688d4bf8095ea61da5953ce0933a4b0f662eabc6783ba57c", "ja": "はぁ……ほんと、この麦茶すごく美味しいわ……！\nランニングの後だからなのかしら？", "zh": "呼……真的耶，这个麦茶好好喝……！\n是因为刚跑完步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5d487fbb7fd2dd71f2fe5d99dc3984e7ae287ea6f03068626adf0f88ee6f223d", "ja": "十分体を休めてくれ。……それにしても、\nひなたはあまり息が乱れてないんだな。", "zh": "大家要充分让身体休息……\n话说回来，日向都不怎么喘呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "798e5de93f8d6bf1003256219e4776defcd4be47ea13d8bf2e23ea1df79d367d", "ja": "うん。ちょっこし疲れたけど、これくらい\n農園の仕事に比べたら、なんでもないべさ。", "zh": "嗯，虽然有点累，不过跟农园的工作比起来，\n这不算什么哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "91b151b02f9ffbc29e3115f937a674c044dded5cd6ecdbbc54e2ebac61627d20", "ja": "それはすごい！　ひなたは意外にスタミナが\nあるんだな。それも、立派な武器だよ。", "zh": "那还真厉害！\n原来日向这么有体力，这也是很棒的一项武器喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "bc16f4af6464df9d84553a411683c4192d6def2e59072e28fa8483dd4ec8d4b4", "ja": "えへへ。体力仕事は、\nよくやってたからねぇ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为我以前很常做体力活嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "da0c1fc649907e38fbc13b6b3c19a95b9bf56d36baf34fa33ae170338623abb3", "ja": "ひなた、すごいやん！　どうやったら\nそんな風に走れるん？", "zh": "日向好厉害呀！\n要怎么做才能跑得像你那样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "09b387eb9d153af59f2da9594ea201f765718f5078bd3822ea537977110aff6c", "ja": "んー、あんまり焦りすぎないこと、だべか……？\nのんびり、一定のペースを保つんだよお。", "zh": "嗯～应该就是，不要太心急吧……？\n要脚步放慢，保持一定的步调哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "625dd53cfb4d9c9ea168321d44334362ca94e720d22e1782639722daa85a3caa", "ja": "一定の歩調……そうだったんですね……。私、\n追いつかなきゃと、気ばかり焦ってしまって……。", "zh": "一定的步调……原来是这样……\n我想着要追上大家才行，就越来越心急……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "74dbf8816a568cc9d6e94982a673fc4ae6f12cc78495666a0a03ab2a8a65ffb8", "ja": "たしかに、ペースを崩してバテちゃったら、元も子も\nないものね。参考になったわ、ひなたちゃん♪", "zh": "有道理，要是因步伐乱掉而耗尽力气，就得不偿失了。\n这个建议很有帮助喔，日向♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "c7d068f144b4c7ae657fb8b07ed4535001fffe1f123c0980c103e183c3c6bb67", "ja": "本当かい？　えへへ、なんだかうれしいよぉ。\nあたしの経験が、役に立つこともあるんだねぇ。", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，有点高兴呢～\n原来我的经验也可以派上用场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "e93cabba9e59eeeb8692e7fe0d130feaee523df4e2fb25486462e9c41940ad90", "ja": "ランニングって奥が深いんやな……。\nひとつ賢なった気いするわ。", "zh": "跑步还真是深奥呀……\n我觉得自己好像又变聪明一点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ad895aeed9e2762d9bdae68dbdd39cf0480fe0e475713b1f740b499f63729cd8", "ja": "一歩前進ってところだな！　収穫もあった事だし、\n今日はこのくらいで切り上げようか。", "zh": "也就是向前迈进了一步呢！\n既然也有收获了，今天就到此为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "36faae377932440ffb42bc5b1731c3f94c7a7b4720cb7d80515b00185cdf4e4e", "ja": "えー！　せっかくひなたにコツ教わったとこなんやし、\nもう少し走りたいです～！", "zh": "咦──！\n难得跟日向学到诀窍了，我想再跑一下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "78e7775b6cf4f4d489b0dc71ba471670f1b2cec7d4d177ffd7be6fe3f3c6da70", "ja": "そ、そうか？　真夏のランニングだから、\n控えめくらいでちょうどいいと思ったんだが……。", "zh": "这、这样吗？我想说在酷暑中跑步，\n少跑一点会比较刚好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "88c9b36d4559a9de457681f5dd1a141225eaee5fd32ee01cda1f91b42b42a9b3", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、私ももう少し走っていきたいです！\nひなたさんの教えを、体得したいので。", "zh": "策划执行人先生，我也想再稍微跑一下！\n我想把日向教的东西学会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4aaee971eaada29c249af4fc2fbc720a6ee62aa66ad2f491bd4956bebd579f13", "ja": "そうか……。じゃあ、長めに休憩をとったら、\nもう一本だけ走ろうか。", "zh": "这样啊……那休息久一点之后，\n再跑一遍就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "c2e85e31947156e9b4745cff9afbb730af59f52583e0852d2610c2073f7ec17c", "ja": "よっしゃ！　さすが{$P$}さん、\n話がわかるわ～♪", "zh": "好耶！不愧是{$P$}先生，\n这么通情达理～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f14ec4e64504981a49e2785e54d43ad3c8e50ef9dbfedb6aa4d621e4b25731b3", "ja": "ただし、無理は禁物だ。なるべく日陰を走って、\nもうダメだと思ったら休んで……。", "zh": "但你们不能硬撑，要尽量跑在有阴影的地方，\n如果觉得不行了就要休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "751375713a6252dd857fab2312c16f881caea6289163c6587404f0d0847a3ef2", "ja": "あはは、{$P$}さん、過保護やなー♪\nそんな心配せんでも大丈夫ですって。な、みんな！", "zh": "哈哈哈，{$P$}先生太过度保护啦～♪\n用不着那么担心也没问题的，大家说对不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "2953a530f96aba0fa6b5fb45b4e82fbf4976514a7495d42621fdad5f6cc86e10", "ja": "もちろん！　汗だくになって、カロリー消費して、\nダイエット成功させちゃうんだから！", "zh": "当然了！我要跑到满身大汗，\n消耗卡路里成功减肥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "7d5024719eb4a1133ec438b3e77136f61a7d53e5ab711f0afe0b564ac51ab972", "ja": "（全員、モチベーションは高いみたいだな。ここは\nみんなの体調に気を配りつつ、見守る事にするか）", "zh": "（大家好像士气高昂呢。\n我就在旁边看着，同时留意她们的身体状况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "8c6fe59fd02edca67f0dcef9a54f4c7abd89ea72366feb2d71cc703aacf72881", "ja": "（長距離走、奈緒、ひなた、莉緒は無事に完走だ！\n残るはエミリーだけだが……）", "zh": "（奈绪、日向、莉绪顺利跑完长跑！\n只剩下艾蜜莉了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1039_032emi", "source_sha256": "5d13565283ef12979bb4eddbff5a15928300e7a2b84f61e2bd14740dc4a4cf3a", "ja": "焦らずに、一定の歩調で……。\nなるほど、この呼吸を意識するんですね……！", "zh": "不要心急，保持一定的步调……\n原来如此，要注意呼吸的频率……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "3235cab5aeae174bf0c770921b60a23040bd2bd6d882a300baeaf115ac846c78", "ja": "おお！　さっきまでと比べて、走りも呼吸も\nめっちゃ安定してるやん！　いけるでエミリー！", "zh": "哦哦！跟之前比起来，步伐跟呼吸都稳定多了耶！\n你可以的，艾蜜莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1041_035hin", "source_sha256": "6afd76aacbc95e02e39ac3e724debe98edf76f1594f48016d4e604be5778e55f", "ja": "前を向いて、がんばって！\nエミリーちゃんなら、絶対出来るべさ！", "zh": "加油，继续向前！\n艾蜜莉的话，一定可以办到哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1042_046rio", "source_sha256": "83be1969391e9802bbaa8d243fcb3dbd195c3b978e22c62c59055f8478681888", "ja": "エミリーちゃん！　最後は、お姉さんの胸に\n飛び込んできていいからね！", "zh": "艾蜜莉！\n最后就扑到姊姊的怀里来也可以喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "683966056ce9705347aec5918a4d110c72d3ce42f306c3e9239e71e4280199fd", "ja": "エミリー！\nゆっくりでいいぞ！　あとちょっとだ！", "zh": "艾蜜莉！\n慢慢跑就好！只差一点点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "dfc2bb3e893a73bef71f3c363ae143b533a33988fdb5f260e5a8ce22830407a9", "ja": "は、はいっ！　……はあ、はあ……！\nや、やりました……到着、です……っ！", "zh": "好、好的！……呼、呼……！\n成、成功了……我跑完了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1045_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d50ca949915116a75b5c9e90c211d0347f1ea231a2e6db2adb483c4e3fffc2b", "ja": "よっしゃぁ！（やったぁ！）", "zh": "好耶！（太棒了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1046_035hin", "source_sha256": "e0bdcfa8f27517c6588bc2641e6ed8b09df9b303ab3e349995840d998d8e2c35", "ja": "やったぁ！", "zh": "太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "a02a65aa214fb0f996316b67d40f3537acfba54b43627fb28e2f18c18e296fb6", "ja": "やったわ！", "zh": "太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1048_035hin", "source_sha256": "1b210cbacd58a6fabb5d7187e9052197d2e88aea63a3b55c802205794a5450a2", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、よくがんばったねぇ！\nはい、これ。小鳥さん特製麦茶だよぉ。", "zh": "艾蜜莉，你做得很棒喔！\n来，这是小鸟姊特制麦茶哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1049_032emi", "source_sha256": "bc2fc40f1d4865c997edd5080f98b7afb0d9720364836ec18012be3b834feb1f", "ja": "はあ、はあ……い、いただきます……わっ！？\nこ、こんなにおいしい麦茶、初めて飲みました！", "zh": "呼、呼……那、那就不客气了……哇！？\n我、我第一次喝到这么好喝的麦茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1050_035hin", "source_sha256": "94df0c1be73eae298e9304eed1d5400853774650bd4fe1fc869c9636114ba791", "ja": "この麦茶、ほんとにおいしいんだよねぇ。\nなんだか、ばあちゃんの麦茶の味に似てるべさ。", "zh": "这个麦茶真的很好喝哪，\n跟奶奶泡的麦茶味道有点像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1051_037nao", "source_sha256": "9aa5d953580d7281dd9a95d075530f516de3fa13d136cda1335e6cb575625bd4", "ja": "小鳥さんの麦茶がおいしいんはほんまやけど、今のは、\nエミリーががんばったからこその味やと思うで！", "zh": "小鸟姊泡的麦茶是很好喝没错，但我觉得刚刚是因为\n艾蜜莉很努力地跑完步，所以才感到特别好喝唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1052_035hin", "source_sha256": "2411f0fb1ad7fbc90442345b44272a6e779e8e536818b3ef43d06d380935a412", "ja": "そうだねぇ。やっぱり体を動かしたあとの\n一杯は、格別だべさ！", "zh": "就是说啊，活动身体之后来一杯，\n果然别有一番滋味哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1053_046rio", "source_sha256": "5b1ffc4bd507b5614790820e0e78d86a1fb3239ced70bbeab9947a9fa5d58e0e", "ja": "当日も、みんなで祝杯があげられるといいわね。\nもちろん、ビールじゃなくて麦茶でね♪", "zh": "希望当天大家也可以一起举杯庆祝呢。\n当然了，不是用啤酒而是用麦茶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "9f8647779567040f5ffe0d95d91b89d01e492f79dec443210359a4cb752ff340", "ja": "（みんな、楽しくやっていけそうでなによりだ。\n音無さんには麦茶の増産を依頼しておかないとな！）", "zh": "（大家看起来都能乐在其中，真是太好了。\n要委托音无小姐增加麦茶的产量才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
